HOW TO ACTIVATE THIS LICENCE

This is a template. Do not commit it as LICENSE with the placeholder in place.
Generate the real file, which also updates the audit ledger and manifest:

    python scripts/activate_codeowners.py \
        --owner @your-github-username \
        --license-owner "Your Full Legal Name Or Company Ltd"

TO CHOOSE A DIFFERENT LICENCE INSTEAD

Replace this template's text before activating. Note that a permissive licence
such as MIT is a genuine grant, not merely a disclaimer: it would allow anyone
to use, copy, modify, distribute, sublicense and SELL this trading system.
For a private, live-capable trading system that is rarely the intent.

